#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:4
msgid "vLLM and LMCache compatibility"
msgstr "vLLM 和 LMCache 兼容性"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:6
msgid ""
"There is no single ``LMCache x vLLM`` version pair that guarantees every "
"model, connector, device, and storage backend. Compatibility has three "
"independent layers:"
msgstr "没有单一的 ``LMCache x vLLM`` 版本组合可以保证与每个模型、连接器、设备和存储后端的兼容性。兼容性有三个独立的层次："

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:10
msgid "the Python, PyTorch, and accelerator runtime must be ABI-compatible;"
msgstr "Python、PyTorch 和加速器运行时必须是 ABI 兼容的；"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:11
msgid ""
"vLLM must be able to load the LMCache connector implementation that you "
"intend to use; and"
msgstr "vLLM 必须能够加载您打算使用的 LMCache 连接器实现；并且"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:13
msgid "the specific model or feature must be validated for that combination."
msgstr "该组合必须验证特定模型或功能。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:15
msgid ""
"Use this page to choose an installation path and to report an exact "
"compatibility result. The :doc:`installation` page contains the commands "
"for each runtime and release channel."
msgstr "使用此页面选择安装路径并报告确切的兼容性结果。:doc:`安装`页面包含每个运行时和发布渠道的命令。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:20
msgid "What the version numbers mean"
msgstr "版本号的含义"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:22
msgid ""
"``vLLM`` and ``LMCache`` are released independently. A newer LMCache "
"release does not automatically mean that every older vLLM release can "
"load every LMCache connector, and a newer vLLM release can change the KV-"
"cache APIs that an integration uses."
msgstr "``vLLM`` 和 ``LMCache`` 是独立发布的。更新的 LMCache 版本并不意味着每个旧的 vLLM 版本都可以加载每个 LMCache 连接器，并且更新的 vLLM 版本可能会更改集成所使用的 KV Cache API。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:27
msgid ""
"The following table separates the checks that are often incorrectly "
"treated as one compatibility matrix:"
msgstr "下表将常常被错误地视为一个兼容性矩阵的检查分开："

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:30
msgid "Compatibility layers"
msgstr "兼容性层"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:34
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "层"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:35
msgid "What must match"
msgstr "必须匹配的内容"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:36
msgid "Recommended action"
msgstr "推荐的操作"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:37
msgid "Runtime and ABI"
msgstr "运行时和 ABI"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:38
msgid ""
"Python minor version, PyTorch build, CUDA/ROCm/oneAPI runtime, native "
"extension ABI, and C++ ABI where applicable."
msgstr "Python 次版本、PyTorch 构建、CUDA/ROCm/oneAPI 运行时、本地扩展 ABI，以及适用时的 C++ ABI。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:40
msgid ""
"Use the LMCache wheel or container for the matching runtime. If the "
"environment uses a different PyTorch build, build LMCache from source "
"against that already-installed PyTorch."
msgstr "使用与匹配运行时相对应的 LMCache wheel 或容器。如果环境使用不同的 PyTorch 构建，请从源代码构建 LMCache，以便与已安装的 PyTorch 兼容。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:43
msgid "Connector loading"
msgstr "连接器加载"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:44
msgid ""
"The vLLM release must support the connector loading mechanism used by the"
" deployment."
msgstr "vLLM 版本必须支持部署中使用的连接器加载机制。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:46
msgid ""
"For vLLM versions that support external connector modules, set "
"``kv_connector_module_path`` to the LMCache connector explicitly. Older "
"releases use the connector implementation bundled by vLLM."
msgstr "对于支持外部连接器模块的 vLLM 版本，明确将 ``kv_connector_module_path`` 设置为 LMCache 连接器。较旧的版本使用 vLLM 捆绑的连接器实现。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:49
msgid "Feature and model"
msgstr "特性和模型"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:50
msgid ""
"KV layout, block size, hybrid/recurrent behavior, transfer mode, device, "
"and storage backend."
msgstr "KV 布局、块大小、混合/递归行为、传输模式、设备和存储后端。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:52
msgid ""
"Follow the relevant model or feature recipe and treat an unlisted "
"combination as unverified until it has been smoke-tested."
msgstr "遵循相关模型或功能的配方，并将未列出的组合视为未经验证，直到经过冒烟测试。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:56
msgid "Installation and ABI compatibility"
msgstr "安装和 ABI 兼容性"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:58
msgid ""
"For a published CUDA installation, use the stable or nightly instructions"
" in :doc:`installation`. LMCache's published native artifacts are built "
"for a particular PyTorch and accelerator runtime; installing a wheel from"
" a different runtime channel can produce native-extension or undefined-"
"symbol errors even when the Python package versions look compatible."
msgstr "对于已发布的 CUDA 安装，请使用 :doc:`installation` 中的稳定版或每日构建版说明。LMCache 发布的本地工件是为特定的 PyTorch 和加速器运行时构建的；从不同的运行时通道安装 wheel 可能会导致本地扩展或未定义符号错误，即使 Python 包版本看起来兼容。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:64
msgid "The practical choices are:"
msgstr "实际选择包括："

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Published stable image or wheel:** use the LMCache release and runtime "
"channel documented together on the installation page. This is the "
"simplest choice for a production deployment."
msgstr "**发布的稳定镜像或轮子：** 使用安装页面上文档中记录的 LMCache 发布和运行时通道。这是生产部署中最简单的选择。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Nightly vLLM or a vLLM source checkout:** use the matching LMCache "
"nightly when the feature is only available on ``dev``. Nightlies are "
"appropriate for testing upcoming integration changes, not as a stable-"
"version guarantee."
msgstr "**每日构建版 vLLM 或 vLLM 源代码检出：** 当功能仅在 ``dev`` 上可用时，请使用匹配的 LMCache 每日构建版。每日构建版适合测试即将到来的集成更改，而不是作为稳定版本的保证。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Custom PyTorch or accelerator build:** install LMCache from source with"
" ``--no-build-isolation`` so its native extensions are compiled against "
"the PyTorch already present in the environment."
msgstr "**自定义 PyTorch 或加速器构建：** 从源代码安装 LMCache，使用 ``--no-build-isolation`` 选项，以便其本地扩展与环境中已存在的 PyTorch 进行编译。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:76
msgid ""
"The release image follows the same rule: the vLLM and LMCache packages "
"inside the image are built as one runtime stack. Do not copy a native "
"LMCache wheel from another CUDA, ROCm, XPU, Python, or PyTorch channel "
"into that image unless the ABI tuple is known to match."
msgstr "发布镜像遵循相同的规则：镜像中的 vLLM 和 LMCache 包作为一个运行时栈构建。除非已知 ABI 元组匹配，否则请勿将来自其他 CUDA、ROCm、XPU、Python 或 PyTorch 渠道的本地 LMCache wheel 复制到该镜像中。"

