#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:201
msgid "Support labels used on this page"
msgstr "支持本页使用的标签"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:203
msgid ""
"**Validated** means the exact environment and scenario are documented "
"with a successful test result."
msgstr "**已验证**意味着确切的环境和场景已记录，并且有成功的测试结果。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:205
msgid ""
"**Required** means a version boundary is needed to access a particular "
"API or integration path; it does not validate every feature above that "
"boundary."
msgstr "**必需**意味着需要一个版本边界才能访问特定的 API 或集成路径；它并不验证该边界以上的每个功能。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:207
msgid ""
"**Recommended** means the installation or development workflow should "
"prefer that channel, but it is not a compatibility guarantee."
msgstr "**推荐**意味着安装或开发工作流应该优先选择该渠道，但这并不保证兼容性。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:209
msgid ""
"**Unverified** means that no exact LMCache result is recorded in the "
"current documentation. It may work, but it should be tested before "
"production use."
msgstr "**未验证**意味着当前文档中没有记录确切的 LMCache 结果。它可能有效，但在生产使用之前应进行测试。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/compatibility.rst:212
msgid ""
"The historical :download:`Installation compatibility CSV "
"<Installation_compatibility_matrix.csv>` covers older LMCache 0.3--0.4 "
"releases. It should not be used as the current source of truth; this page"
" and the linked feature recipes describe the current compatibility "
"policy."
msgstr "历史 :download:`安装兼容性 CSV <Installation_compatibility_matrix.csv>` 涵盖了较早的 LMCache 0.3--0.4 版本。它不应作为当前的真实来源；本页面及链接的功能食谱描述了当前的兼容性政策。"

